WEBVTT

NOTE key=1bb2f2713dfbc533

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.740
An old man was talking to his grandson.

2
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:08.255
"There is a fight inside me," he said. "It is between two wolves."

3
00:00:08.755 --> 00:00:11.670
"One wolf is anger, envy and fear."

4
00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:15.269
"The other is peace, hope and patience."

5
00:00:15.769 --> 00:00:19.578
"The same fight is inside you, and inside every person."

6
00:00:20.078 --> 00:00:22.098
The boy thought for a long time.

7
00:00:22.598 --> 00:00:25.024
Then he asked, "Which wolf wins?"

8
00:00:25.524 --> 00:00:27.405
The old man was quiet.

9
00:00:27.905 --> 00:00:29.786
"The one you feed," he said.

10
00:00:30.286 --> 00:00:32.619
The boy never forgot that answer.
